:8787&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=16;absoluteArcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#6366f1;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;container=1;collapsible=0;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1170" y="70" width="610" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="tools:  agents · start · send · wait · respond · sessions · stop" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#6366f1;fontColor=#312e81;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="120" width="570" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#312e81;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/mcp&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#475569;font-family:JetBrains Mono,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Streamable HTTP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6366f1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="162" width="140" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#312e81;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;OAuth 2.1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#475569;font-family:Inter,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;own AS · PKCE · CIMD/DCR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6366f1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;shadow=1;" ver